  q(IT,'Which device keeps a server running for a short time during a power outage and allows a safe shutdown?','Uninterruptible power supply',['Network switch','Wireless access point','Patch panel'],'B','A UPS bridges the gap until generator power arrives or the system can shut down safely.',AAMI)
